the power system in one piece is one of  the most unique and innovative you'll  find in anime instead of a complicated  energy force that you struggle to wrap  your head around or some quirky magic  what you get is a fancy looking fruit  that gives its eater incredible powers  and a bad taste in the mouth it's called  a devil fruit but you already know that  don't you and it comes with a forstean  deal those who eat it and inherit its  powers automatically lose the ability to  swim  and survive in water devil fruits aren't  that complicated there are just three  categories paramecia  logia and zoen paramecias are the most  common type and give their users an  endless variety of abilities  logia fruits are rare and their users  gain the ability to create  manipulate and transform into some sort  of natural element  zoens create human animal hybrids devil  fruit powers vary wildly some are more  basic than others like the ability to  make your target turn into stone or to  turn your own body into sand well we're  talking basic by one piece standards of  course  others are simply crazy imagine gaining  the ability to grow countless limbs on  your body or being able to manipulate  stone to the extent that you can turn an  entire country  into a part of yourself within this  insane variety there are some devil  fruit powers that are best described as  overpowered they give their owners such  godlike powers it's no wonder how anyone  can stand up to them that brings us to  the subject of today's video which is  the top 10 overpowered devil fruit  powers in one piece let's take a look at  them  kicking off this list is the string  string fruit eaten by  don quixote doflamingo when it comes to  doffy his devil fruit power is one of  the last things about him that strikes  you that's because he's such an  intriguing character even without it  there's the way he looks  his evil grin and his raspy voice there  are multiple personalities that he's  cultivated a fallen noble turned pirate  a ruthless underworld arms dealer a  slave driver and the man who thinks  nothing of killing his own brother  there's his haki prowess which makes him  one of the biggest threats around  you might be forgiven if you think the  string string fruit's powers aren't that  special but take a closer look and  you'll find it's a deadly power it gives  doffy the ability to create an unlimited  number of  tiny razor-sharp strings that he can  manipulate at will  these harmless looking strings can slice  buildings in half create a cage large  enough to enclose an entire country turn  people into puppets and even repair the  user's internal organs embooing the  string with haki makes them even more  deadly it's a power truly worthy of its  wielder  [Applause]  [Music]  more  oh  us at number nine is the power of  admiral kizaru's glint glint fruit the  admiral might not look much like a  threat  but he has the most powerful and  versatile devil fruit power among the  marine higher-ups which makes him a  class  a hazard and the only human capable of  riding a cannonball the glinkling fruit  blesses kizaru with the powers to create  control and transform into light turning  him into a light human this means he can  travel at the speed of light  making him almost unstoppable with his  power of light hizaru can shoot high  speed high precision laser beams from  his fingertips and feet these lasers  have the same piercing effects as  bullets shot from a gun additionally he  can blind his opponents with his light  or create weapons of light such as a  sword to fight them it's no wonder then  that he gave the straw hat such a hard  time before the skip  [Music]  um  i think we all know why this makes the  list a power to continuously regenerate  is pretty overpowered isn't it  especially if you're in a battle shonen  series not to mention how cool it looks  in its fully transformed form  this is one of the five mythical zoen  we've seen in the one piece canon  marco's control over his transformation  seems to be one of the greatest among  other zoen users shown so far it allows  him to transform into a legendary  phoenix granting him the ability to fly  and control phoenix fire which doesn't  just heal him but can be used to heal  others wounds too one of the reasons why  it doesn't get higher is because  offensively it's not as useful as some  of the other devil fruits on this list  coming in at number seven is the pawpaw  fruit  [Music]  don't be deceived by how adorable it  sounds or by the fact that it gives its  user soft pink padded paws and leaves  q-poor imprints whenever it's used  behind its unassuming name this devil  fruit holds one of the most mysterious  powers ever seen it allows bartholomew  humor its user to deflect  anything from enemy attacks to people  and even ghosts and send them flying at  the speed  of light it endows him with great speed  and the ability to compress  air and turn it into a massive explosion  he can even push out the pain in a  person's body put it inside an air  bubble and transfer that pain into  another's body perhaps because of his  gentle nature humor doesn't always use  his devil fruit powers to hurt others  when he sends the straw hats flying in  different directions  all of them arrive safe and sound at  their destinations despite having  travelled in his air bubble for three  days and three nights  [Music]  the rumble rumble fruit allows its eater  to create control and turn into  lightning move at lightning speed and  send 200 million volt lightning bolts  crashing down on its opponents that's  not all the user can also  create control and transform into  electricity  merge with and manipulate metal hear  electrical  sound waves many many miles away and  even jump start their own heart with a  jolt of electricity  touching a person with the power of the  rumble rumble fruit means being fried  with hundreds of thousands of volts of  electricity it's no wonder that it's  user nl has the nickname god attached to  his name  it's just his bad luck that he happened  to run into the one person  capable of withstanding his electrifying  personality  a certain rubber man by a minor  character's account the rumble rumble  fruit is the most powerful of the rare  logia fruits  [Music]  at the halfway mark now we have a  sinister power in the hands of a 10 year  old like the poor poor fruit the hobby  hobby fruit has a harmless  even cheerful ring to its name but it  holds a power so  terrible it's capable of enslaving an  entire population the devil fruit gives  its users the power to turn people into  toys with just a touch  control their every movement erase  others memories of them while tragically  allowing them to retain their own it  also gives the person who eats it the  gift of eternal youth which is why  sugar a member of the don quixote family  and the owner of the hobby hobby fruit  hasn't aged a day in 12 years  what makes this fruit even more sinister  is the fact that sugar uses its powers  to help doffy create a huge  underworld in dressrosa that runs on the  backs of slaves whilst presenting an  outward picture of a prosperous and  peaceful country despite being  overpowered the hobby hobby fruit has  one  big weakness which we won't be revealing  suffice to say it's the reason why usopp  becomes god usopp in one of the most  unusual power-ups in shonen anime  number four the dark dark fruit  it's time to go z because the next entry  on the list is the despicable  blackbeard's terrifying power of the  dark dark fruit  the power of darkness in this fruit  gives its users the ability to  manipulate  darkness this manifests in the form of a  black hole or void that swallows  everything in its wake be it a person or  an entire city though it doesn't  necessarily destroy them in the process  when blackbeard wields it the black hole  also spits out what it swallowed the  yonko is able to pull his opponent into  the dark abyss with a mysterious  