se cracks in  turn  create large shock waves which bring  about earthquakes and tsunamis that can  destroy  entire islands the user can also flip  large objects and places on their head  an extremely frightening way to use this  power is by holding one's enemy by their  head and concentrating the vibrations  around it defeating the opponent  instantly in the hands of whitebeard the  world's strongest man the tremor tremor  fruit was never used for evil rather we  can safely assume that its powers were  used to protect many nations and  countries from more  ruthless pirates and let's not forget  they gave the marines a massive fight in  the battle of marineford unfortunately  the fruit was stolen rather deviously by  blackbeard and we can only wonder how  he'll use his tremendous powers to  further his evil plan  one piece  it's time to unveil our top pick now and  the honor goes to  big mom's soul soul fruit which puts a  horrifying spin on the old halloween  tradition of trick or treat  the power of the soul-soul fruit makes  its use a manipulator of souls  as such big mom can extract the soul of  a person or a part of it and transfer it  into an inanimate object  bringing it to life that explains her  army of talking trees  flowers animals furnitures and cakes  they might look cute but like sugar's  toys  they're far from innocent beings the  soul extraction means the person who  parts with a portion of their soul loses  some part of their lifespan as well when  big moms being unreasonable  it might even come down to parting with  one's life the fruit also allows the  yonko to use portions of her soul to  create humanoid creatures called  incarnations that go about collecting  people's souls on her behalf however  there's a condition that must be  fulfilled for the soul souls fruit to  work which is that the target must be  afraid of the user given big mom's  insatiable hunger pangs and the  destruction she's capable of at times  this isn't a difficult ask at all 